{"blocks":[{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" \nDepartment for Work and Pensions\n ","tree_line_end":8,"tree_line_start":2},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" DECISION MAKING AND APPEALS (PART OF STRATEGIC COMMUNICATIONS) ","tree_line_end":10,"tree_line_start":9},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":12,"tree_line_start":11},{"depth":1,"role":"H1","text":"Decision Makers Guide ","tree_line_end":14,"tree_line_start":13},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":16,"tree_line_start":15},{"depth":1,"role":"H2","text":"Volume 2 ","tree_line_end":18,"tree_line_start":17},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"Amendment 39 – Feb 2018 ","tree_line_end":20,"tree_line_start":19},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":22,"tree_line_start":21},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":24,"tree_line_start":23},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"1. This letter provides details on Amendment 39; the changes have already been incorporated in to the Intranet and Internet versions of the DMG.  ","tree_line_end":26,"tree_line_start":25},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":28,"tree_line_start":27},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"2. PDF amendment packages are also available. These can be printed with the amended pages being reproduced in full. Each page will contain the amendment number in the footer  ","tree_line_end":30,"tree_line_start":29},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":32,"tree_line_start":31},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"PDF amendment packages can be found on the Intranet at: ","tree_line_end":34,"tree_line_start":33},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":36,"tree_line_start":35},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":"http://intralink/1/lg/acileeds/guidance/decision%20makers%20guide/index.asp\n ","tree_line_end":43,"tree_line_start":37},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" ","tree_line_end":45,"tree_line_start":44},{"depth":1,"role":"P","text":" or on the Internet at the ‘Amdt Packages’ tab on the following link: ","tree_line_end":47,"tree_li